{"hash":"49d5ffa2d2d4730b","voice":"en-IN-NeerjaExpressiveNeural","rate":"+4%","dur":61.033,"said":"Step through the open gate, past Nandi, and pause. You are standing where very few pilgrims stand today. In the real temple, since 2020 the garbhagriha has been open only to VIPs, the temple’s priests and invited dignitaries. Every other pilgrim, like the queue you just walked with, takes darshan from the Ganesh Mandapam barricade behind you. The closure began in the pandemic and has been extended again and again, with only short openings; in 2025 the Madhya Pradesh High Court left it to the Collector to decide who may enter, and in early 2026 the Supreme Court declined to hear a challenge to VIP entry. Here, in this virtual yatra, the door is open to you. So go in, and see up close what most devotees only glimpse on the screens: the walls sheathed in embossed silver, the south-facing linga crowned with flowers, the silver jalahari around it, and the priests chanting at its side.","segments":[{"key":"text","start":0,"end":892}],"words":[[0.098,0.361,0,4],[0.471,0.192,5,12],[0.675,0.084,13,16],[0.771,0.312,17,21],[1.096,0.385,22,26],[1.685,0.373,28,32],[2.069,0.481,33,38],[2.67,0.252,40,43],[2.935,0.409,44,49],[4.255,0.204,51,54],[4.471,0.12,55,58],[4.603,0.505,59,67],[5.12,0.168,68,73],[5.301,0.312,74,78],[5.625,0.228,79,82],[5.865,0.529,83,91],[6.406,0.361,92,97],[6.779,0.373,98,103],[8.065,0.12,105,107],[8.197,0.072,108,111],[8.281,0.288,112,116],[8.582,0.541,117,123],[9.327,1.418,125,135],[10.757,0.108,136,139],[10.877,0.709,140,151],[11.599,0.264,152,155],[11.875,0.18,156,160],[12.067,0.433,161,165],[12.512,0.337,166,170],[12.861,0.192,171,173],[13.065,0.745,174,178],[14.05,0.108,180,183],[14.171,0.541,184,192],[14.724,0.541,193,200],[15.276,0.156,201,204],[15.445,0.589,205,212],[16.046,0.805,213,224],[17.716,0.361,226,231],[18.089,0.24,232,237],[18.341,0.553,238,245],[19.075,0.204,247,251],[19.291,0.12,252,255],[19.423,0.252,256,261],[19.688,0.144,262,265],[19.84